    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the community</h1><p>Follow me on Twitter<br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Embrace the legend of Jack, codenamed Phantom, a war-worn veteran imprisoned for his past. When a clandestine agency, K.I.A, extends an offer of freedom in exchange for his unparalleled skills, join Phantom on a gripping journey to reclaim his life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300930/extras/a98c2f9447b8baaca3edcaccd991ec15.poster.avif?t=1754943976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300930/extras/a98c2f9447b8baaca3edcaccd991ec15.webm?t=1754943976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300930/extras/a98c2f9447b8baaca3edcaccd991ec15.mp4?t=1754943976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Mission Types:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Sabotage enemy plans<br></li><li> Steal equipment<br></li><li> Execute targets<br></li><li> Execute heists<br></li><li> Steal transport</li></ul><br><strong>Mechanics:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Emphasis on stealth<br></li><li> Special gear provided by K.I.A<br></li><li> Neck stabbing</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300930/extras/8fbcc7d1398ce8cf0ade18ceffa84cde.poster.avif?t=1754943976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300930/extras/8fbcc7d1398ce8cf0ade18ceffa84cde.webm?t=1754943976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300930/extras/8fbcc7d1398ce8cf0ade18ceffa84cde.mp4?t=1754943976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Story Mode:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Engaging narrative<br></li><li> Unlocks challenges for maps</li></ul><br><strong>Challenge Mode:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Difficult and time-bound<br></li><li> Unlocks as you play the story</li></ul><br><strong>Note From the Developer:</strong><br>This game is made by one person, I am a big fan of old school hard stealth games where they are hard at first but then you start doing speed runs.<br><br>That's What This Game Is About.",
    "about_the_game": "Embrace the legend of Jack, codenamed Phantom, a war-worn veteran imprisoned for his past. When a clandestine agency, K.I.A, extends an offer of freedom in exchange for his unparalleled skills, join Phantom on a gripping journey to reclaim his life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300930/extras/a98c2f9447b8baaca3edcaccd991ec15.poster.avif?t=1754943976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300930/extras/a98c2f9447b8baaca3edcaccd991ec15.webm?t=1754943976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300930/extras/a98c2f9447b8baaca3edcaccd991ec15.mp4?t=1754943976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Mission Types:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Sabotage enemy plans<br></li><li> Steal equipment<br></li><li> Execute targets<br></li><li> Execute heists<br></li><li> Steal transport</li></ul><br><strong>Mechanics:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Emphasis on stealth<br></li><li> Special gear provided by K.I.A<br></li><li> Neck stabbing</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300930/extras/8fbcc7d1398ce8cf0ade18ceffa84cde.poster.avif?t=1754943976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300930/extras/8fbcc7d1398ce8cf0ade18ceffa84cde.webm?t=1754943976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300930/extras/8fbcc7d1398ce8cf0ade18ceffa84cde.mp4?t=1754943976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Story Mode:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Engaging narrative<br></li><li> Unlocks challenges for maps</li></ul><br><strong>Challenge Mode:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Difficult and time-bound<br></li><li> Unlocks as you play the story</li></ul><br><strong>Note From the Developer:</strong><br>This game is made by one person, I am a big fan of old school hard stealth games where they are hard at first but then you start doing speed runs.<br><br>That's What This Game Is About.",
    "short_description": "K.I.A is a comedic, old-school, hard stealth first-person shooter where players step into the shoes of Jack, a war veteran offered freedom by an enigmatic K.I.A agent in exchange for his unparalleled skills, This game refuses to take itself seriously.",
